Subject: feat(ios): support interactive keyboard dismissal on scrollers

Add Modifier.keyboardDismissModeInteractiveIOS() (and
ScrollerAttr.keyboardDismissModeInteractiveIOS) that sets the iOS
KRScrollView keyboardDismissMode to Interactive, so dragging a list can
pull the keyboard down. Other platforms ignore the property.

